t fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n\r\nEnsure that `EditorResourcePreview::check_for_invalidation()` is called after the cached instance is reloaded:\r\n1. For importable files: after the `resources_reimported` signal is emitted;\r\n2. For other files: after the `resources_reload` signal is emitted;\r\n\r\nCache the `callable` within the `cache` of `EditorResourcePreview` to facilitate regenerating the previews for cached resource instances.\r\n\r\nWhen generating a preview for a file, simultaneously attempt to regenerate the preview for its cached instance (if a preview has previously been generated).\r\n\r\n\r\nFix #33745.\r\nFix part of #117048. A complete fix requires using this in conjunction with #117515.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c156164a-1421-47ee-96be-7e1bf4edda32\r\n\r\n\r\nThis PR + #117515:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec220b1e-2d41-41ca-8c3f-53f6185fd4aa\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Go